# Cloudflare Origin CA cert + key live here on the VPS.
#
# Operator generates origin.pem + origin.key in CF dashboard → SSL/TLS →
# Origin Server (see docs/deploy/install.md §2 step 4) and saves them to
# this directory. docker-compose.prod.yml mounts the directory into the
# nginx container as /etc/nginx/certs:ro.
#
# This .gitkeep keeps the empty directory tracked so the volume mount in
# docker-compose.prod.yml has a path to bind to on a fresh git clone.
# Actual cert files (origin.pem / origin.key) are .gitignored — they are
# secrets and live only on the VPS.
